OL,3,GNEWSACouncil estimates bridge
OL,4,Areplacement could cost more than #40m
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncil officials have estimated that
OL,7,Fit would cost #43.7m to replace a
OL,8,Fbridge which was closed for more than
OL,9,F100 days on safety grounds.
OL,11,FThe sudden closure of the Kirkcudbright
OL,12,FBridge in March 2025 split the town in
OL,13,Ftwo, causing disruption to local
OL,14,Fbusinesses and residents.
OL,16,FSince it reopened the following July,
OL,17,Fonly cars, light vans and motorbikes
OL,18,Fhave been able to use it and single
OL,19,Flane traffic management is in place.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
