OL,3,GNEWSACouncil estimates bridge
OL,4,Areplacement could cost more than #40m
OL,5,
OL,6,FNext week Dumfries and Galloway Council
OL,7,Fwill be asked to approve an initial
OL,8,F#6.19m to pay for preliminary work
OL,9,Fbefore deciding whether a full
OL,10,Freplacement should go ahead.
